# Netlify / Cloudflare Pages. Cross-origin isolation lets MediaPipe run its
# WASM multi-threaded; see vite.config.ts for why COEP is credentialless.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: credentialless

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
